* Can be found by destroying bones in [[Frost Caves]].
* Can be found by destroying bones surrounding [[Tar Pit]]s in the [[Plains]].
* Can be found by destroying bones in [[Putrid Hole]] in [[Ashlands]] biomes.
* Can also be found in the [[Sunken Crypts]] in [[Swamp]] biomes.
* Dropped by destroyed [[Skugg]].

== Usage ==

